OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785840489
OL,3,CMan jailed after claiming electric
OL,4,CJaguar was out of control on motorways
OL,6,FA man who drove his electric Jaguar at
OL,7,Fhigh speeds on motorways and claimed
OL,8,Fit would not brake in a "frighteningly
OL,9,Fstupid" attempt to avoid paying his
OL,10,Fcar finance has been jailed.
OL,12,FNathan Owen, 33, collided with a
OL,13,Fpolice car 31 times as officers
OL,14,Fattempted to stop him after he phoned
OL,15,Femergency services to tell them his
OL,16,Fvehicle was accelerating and not in
OL,17,Fhis control, Liverpool Crown Court
OL,18,Fheard on Monday 3 August.
OL,26,@pD@YOUqD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785840489
OL,3,CMan jailed after claiming electric
OL,4,CJaguar was out of control on motorways
OL,6,FHe drove at speeds of up to 86mph on
OL,7,Fthe M58, M57 and M62 in Merseyside for
OL,8,Fabout 35 minutes, over a distance of
OL,9,Fabout 38 miles, during the incident on
OL,10,F6 March 2024.
OL,12,FSentencing him, Judge Ian Unsworth KC
OL,13,Fsaid: "You set in train a course of
OL,14,Fconduct which caused a significant
OL,15,Fpolice traffic operation to be
OL,16,Fdeployed, undoubted alarm to the
OL,17,Fpublic and very substantial loss and
OL,18,Fdisruption to others."
OL,26,@uD@GOUzD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785840489
OL,3,CMan jailed after claiming electric
OL,4,CJaguar was out of control on motorways
OL,6,FThe judge said police officers placed
OL,7,Fthemselves in danger because they
OL,8,Fbelieved they were dealing with a
OL,9,Fgenuine emergency.
OL,11,FAddressing Owen, he added: "You,
OL,12,Fmeanwhile, sought to profit from a
OL,13,Flie."
OL,15,FEric Lamb, prosecuting, said Owen, of
OL,16,FPrestatyn, North Wales, had entered
OL,17,Finto a finance agreement in September
OL,18,F2023 for the Jaguar I-Pace.
OL,26,@sD@\OUuD@EO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785840489
OL,3,CMan jailed after claiming electric
OL,4,CJaguar was out of control on motorways
OL,6,FHe ran into "financial difficulties"
OL,7,Fand was in arrears with CA Auto
OL,8,FFinance by March the following year
OL,9,Fwith about #5,000 left to pay, the
OL,10,Fcourt heard.
OL,12,FOn the day of the incident, he called
OL,13,Floan company Plata to ask if he would
OL,14,Fbe able to borrow more on top of the
OL,15,F#3,000 he had already loaned from
OL,16,Fthem, but was told he could not.
OL,26,@nD@MOUnD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785840489
OL,3,CMan jailed after claiming electric
OL,4,CJaguar was out of control on motorways
OL,6,FFive minutes later, shortly after 2pm,
OL,7,Fhe called 999 claiming his car would
OL,8,Fnot brake and he had no control over
OL,9,Fthe vehicle, which he said was
OL,10,Faccelerating.
OL,12,FMr Lamb said: "In fact, his car was
OL,13,Fstationary at the time of that call."
OL,15,FPolice attended and the car, which was
OL,16,Fthen travelling at speeds of up to
OL,17,F86mph, had to be boxed off by
OL,18,Femergency service vehicles to keep
OL,19,Fother road users safe before it came
OL,20,Fto a stop on the M62 near Warrington,
OL,21,FCheshire.
OL,26,@tD@OOUuD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785840489
OL,3,CMan jailed after claiming electric
OL,4,CJaguar was out of control on motorways
OL,6,FInvestigations found there was no
OL,7,Ffault with the car, the court heard.
OL,9,FMr Lamb said: "He had fabricated the
OL,10,Fevents in order to enable him to get
OL,11,Frid of the vehicle.
OL,13,F"He had full control of the vehicle
OL,14,Fand with full control of the vehicle
OL,15,Fhe travelled at excessive and extreme
OL,16,Fspeeds."
OL,18,FMotorways had to be closed as a result
OL,19,Fof the incident, the court heard.
OL,26,@qD@OOUuD@AOUxD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785840489
OL,3,CMan jailed after claiming electric
OL,4,CJaguar was out of control on motorways
OL,6,FFootage of the police pursuit of Owen
OL,7,Fwas played in court, along with the
OL,8,Faudio from his 999 call, in which he
OL,9,Fwas heard telling an operator he was
OL,10,F"shaking" and the car had "gone crazy".
OL,12,FWhen the car was eventually brought to
OL,13,Fa stop the brake lights could be seen
OL,14,Fturning on.
OL,16,FOwen contacted the finance company 40
OL,17,Fminutes after the incident.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@IO]rD@[OUrD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785840489
OL,3,CMan jailed after claiming electric
OL,4,CJaguar was out of control on motorways
OL,6,FIn a statement, Murray Paul, from
OL,7,FJaguar Land Rover UK, said the firm
OL,8,Fhad spent an extra #50 million in
OL,9,Fmarketing to try and counter the
OL,10,Fpublicity from the false allegations,
OL,11,Fwhich they said generated 180 pieces
OL,12,Fof adverse media coverage.
OL,14,FDaniel Travers, defending, said Owen's
OL,15,Factions were "frighteningly stupid".
OL,26,@wD@NOUwD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785840489
OL,3,CMan jailed after claiming electric
OL,4,CJaguar was out of control on motorways
OL,6,FHe said Owen, who had no previous
OL,7,Fconvictions and came from a
OL,8,F"successful, stable family", had been
OL,9,Fdescribed by his father as a Walter
OL,10,FMitty character who "lives in a
OL,11,Ffantasy world".
OL,13,FHe added: "He had grand ideas and
OL,14,Fthings just went wrong."
OL,16,FOwen pleaded guilty to dangerous
OL,17,Fdriving and two counts of fraud in
OL,18,FJune.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@[O]rD@UOUsD@NO]uD@KOUvD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785840489
OL,3,CMan jailed after claiming electric
OL,4,CJaguar was out of control on motorways
OL,6,FHe was banned from driving for a
OL,7,Fperiod of five years after his release
OL,8,Ffrom custody.
OL,10,FSpeaking after the sentencing,
OL,11,FDetective Constable Michael Doyle
OL,12,Fsaid: "It was clear from our
OL,13,Finvestigations that he was in full
OL,14,Fcontrol of his vehicle throughout the
OL,15,Fduration of the incident.
OL,17,F"By his own admission there were
OL,18,Fworkers on the hard shoulder of the
OL,19,Fmotorway and he clearly put them and
OL,20,Fother road users in danger with his
OL,21,Freckless actions."
OL,26,@tD@GOUyD@AOU}D@RO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/11
